OL,3,GNEWSACity centre festival cut short by
OL,4,Aweather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second day of a city centre
OL,7,Ffestival has been called off because of
OL,8,Fbad weather.
OL,10,FThe Big Feast in Hanley is a free
OL,11,Ftwo-day event which began on Friday,
OL,12,Fbut organisers Appetite said Saturday's
OL,13,FBig Feast programme would not go ahead,
OL,14,Fwith the exception of Tender Exchange
OL,15,Fat the Potteries Centre.
OL,17,FIt said an "enormous amount of work,
OL,18,Fcare and creativity" had gone into the
OL,19,Fplanning of the event, and it was
OL,20,F"gutted" to cut it short.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
