OL,3,GNEWSACity centre festival cut short by
OL,4,Aweather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers added: "The safety and
OL,7,Fwellbeing of our artists, audiences,
OL,8,Fvolunteers and team has to come first.
OL,9,FWith the conditions we're facing today,
OL,10,Fwe're sadly unable to deliver the
OL,11,Ffestival programme safely."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
